{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) − 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0

Rule 30 (list of bools for masking or selection)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : list(bool)} |= v_2.len = shape(v_1, 0)

Rule 13 (tensor must have a floating-point dtype: 6–8)
{v1: tensor} |= 6 ≤ dtype(v1) ∧ dtype(v1) ≤ 8

